{
  "name": "lean-pooled-h5-fill-label-1m",
  "notes": "One-minute fill-label walk: the lean pooled LightGBM recipe TRAINED and SCORED on rows every minute (full-window 1-minute caches built by cache_build_document with row_window [2020-05-01, 2026-02-28)), label close[t+1] -> close[t+1+h] (label_entry_offset_bars=1, SPY-residual, vol-scaled at t). Frozen per-lead estimator params from the ADR-0185 warmup HPO winners (no inner HPO: a 1-minute inner search is ~5x the 5-minute cost); leads 1..5 only (h6-h10 cover LRCX+MSTR alone). Development evidence only, same development_validation folds. Path heads are clipped to lead 5 (LRCX and MSTR were certified at 10) because this document runs scans h01-h05 only; the path score here is a 1-minute-row diagnostic, not the locked P16 score.",
